<title>FINLAND: ENSTO JAN-AUG PROFIT FIM 18.3 MLN VS 22.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>ENSTO JAN-AUG PROFIT FIM 18.3 MLN VS 22.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items    18.3 vs 22.4</p>
<p> Net sales				   632.4 vs 573.9</p>
<p> Operating profit			   23.7 vs 25.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish electrical equipment maker is Oy</p>
<p>Ensto Ab.</p>
